    "5-entry rolling average. Marks show where the font or size changed — a dip after a change is expected, the letters just got harder.": {},
    "A PIN keeps a sibling out — it is not security.": {},
    "A big letter %@ to trace": {},
    "A finger isn't handwriting. Dragging a fingertip builds none of the habits a pencil does — how to hold it, how hard to press, where the hand rests — so the app would be practising the wrong thing.": {},
    "A grown-up agreed on %@.": {},
    "A grown-up can let Journal use the camera in Settings. You can still choose a photo instead.": {},
    "A grown-up needs to agree": {},
    "A profile PIN is a courtesy lock, not security. It keeps a brother or sister out of someone else's journal — it will not stop a determined grown-up, and nothing here is encrypted.": {},
    "A thousand words in your own hand.": {},
    "A tracing at 90% or better.": {},
    "A trend needs 5 entries with one font and size.\n%@ has %lld — keep going!": {},
