    "The app sends anonymous crash reports and usage statistics so we can fix problems and improve it — which screens are used, how long a session lasts, which typeface is chosen. Never the words on a page, ink, names, photos or voice, and never sold. The privacy policy has the details.": {},
    "The microphone could not start": {},
    "The microphone feeds speech recognition on this iPad and nothing else. No audio is recorded or kept, and the words your child says never leave the iPad.": {},
    "The microphone is switched off": {},
    "The page is graded stroke by stroke — where the ink went, in which direction, in what order. A fingertip is wider than the strokes it would trace, and the scores would mean nothing.": {},
    "The red letters were written in a different order.\nWatch how %@ is written…": {},
    "The thickest — easiest to stay inside.": {},
    "There is no account, and what your child says and writes never leaves this iPad unless a grown-up shares a PDF. The privacy policy explains the anonymous crash reports and usage statistics.": {},
    "This entry": {},
    "This is a handwriting app. Your child writes with a pencil in their hand, just as they do on paper — the grip, the pressure, the hand resting on the page, every letter formed stroke by stroke. That is what the app teaches and what it grades, so it doesn't start without one.": {},
